{"about_the_game":"<strong>Welcome to Downfall of Krynto!</strong><br>A Game in Retro inspired RPG Setting. Turn-Based Battles and an Open World to Explore with puzzles and secrets spread out everywhere.<br>This Game has a Dark Story and there will be lots of cool animated and hand-drawn battle scenes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829940/extras/7e48b974111ff2e5a12a1668c8fbf5df.avif?t=1707912053\" width=616 height=1080 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Open world 2D RPG/Adventure</strong><br></li><li> <strong>50 Main Dungeons</strong> to enter in any order you want<br></li><li> Wide landscape filled with secrets, quests, caves and loot<br></li><li> <strong>8 Playable Characters</strong> with their own stats and progression points for custom character building<br></li><li> Stylized graphics mixed with pixel art<br></li><li> The Creator of &quot;<strong>Moonstone - A Hard Day's Knight</strong>&quot; [Amiga] (Rob Anderson) lended Sloppy Joe Studios the rights to use one of the well known enemies (Trogg).<br></li><li> Lots of content to the story<br></li><li> A <strong>Reputation system</strong><br></li><li> A <strong>Crafting System</strong> for Weapons &amp; Armor, but also items like potions<br></li><li> <strong>Lovely music</strong> from Kevin MacLeod, Prakrit Safari, Ozzed<br></li><li> <strong>3</strong> different endings<br></li><li> <strong>1-4 Players local Co-op</strong> (Drop in/out at any time)<br></li><li> Cool <strong>unique Battle Scene</strong> filled with <strong>awesome animations</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Original Artwork</strong><br></li><li> Music made for a <strong>GRAND ADVENTURE</strong><br></li><li> <strong>60 Hours of Gameplay (Main Quest)</strong></li></ul><br>And MUCH more...!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829940/extras/dd5fba9